28391.indication:
Amlodipine and Atorvastatin is indicated in patients for whom treatment with both amlodipine and atorvastatin is appropriate.

Atorvastatin is indicated as an adjunct to diet to reduce elevated total-C, LDL-C, apo B, and triglycerides (TG) levels and to increase HDL-C in patients with primary hypercholesterolemia (heterozygous familial and nonfamilial) and mixed dyslipidemia; 

